er":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[7,5,0,12.83],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0516,"r5":0.0969,"r1_spy":0.0486,"r5_spy":0.0961}}],"quotes":[{"c":"ALSN 2018 Q4","e":"alsn","d":"2019-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"Net sales increased 10% compared to the same period in 2017 to $647 million, principally driven by higher demand in the Outside North America Off-Highway and North America On-Highway end markets, as well as price increases on certain products and the continued execution of our growth initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/26/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q4-2018-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2018 Q4","e":"alsn","d":"2019-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"Gross margin for the quarter was 52.2%, an increase of 320 basis points as compared to 49% for the same period in 2017, principally driven by increased net sales, price increases on certain products, and favorable material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/26/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q4-2018-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2018 Q4","e":"alsn","d":"2019-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"Consistent with Q3, favorable material costs continue to be driven by several multiyear cost reduction initiatives, partially offset by unfavorable raw material cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/26/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q4-2018-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2019-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"…of 160 basis points as compared to 51.6% for the same period in 2018, principally driven by a reduction in expenses related to the retirement incentive program for certain UAW Local 933 employees, increased net sales, price increases on certain products and lower incentive compensation expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q1-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2019-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"…applications, partially offset by increased demand in the North America On-Highway end market, price increases on certain products and the continued execution of our growth initiatives. Additionally, Allison anticipates net income in the range of $525 million to $575 million, adjusted EBITDA…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q1-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2019-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"So, as you saw in our guide, I mean we've reaffirmed our guide that we provided in February.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q1-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"Gross margin for the quarter was 52.8%, an increase of 20 basis points as compared to 52.6% for the same period in 2018, principally driven by increased net sales and price increases on certain products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q2-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"…quarter was 52% a decrease of 120 basis points as compared to 53.2% the same period in 2018 principally driven by lower net sales and higher manufacturing expenses commensurate with increased On-Highway volume partially offset by price increases on certain products and favorable material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q3-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"…applications partially offset by increased demand in North America On-Highway end market price increases on certain products and the continued execution of our growth initiatives. Our implied fourth quarter adjusted free cash flow guidance includes capital expenditures for the previously","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q3-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"I would say the end users the service providers are taking very aggressive steps to rightsize the amount of equipment that they have fielded.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q3-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"I mean one thing I guess I point out we reaffirmed guide narrowed the ranges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q3-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"And really with the Q2 guide as well where we've in effect narrowed the ranges and reaffirm guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q3-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q4","e":"alsn","d":"2020-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"The decrease is principally driven by lower net sales and unfavorable mix, partially offset by price increases on certain products and favorable material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q4-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2019 Q4","e":"alsn","d":"2020-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"…decrease of 10% compared to the net sales for 2019, reflecting lower demand in the Global On-Highway and Global Off-Highway end markets, partially offset by increased demand in the Service Parts, Support Equipment & Other and Defense end markets, as well as price increases on certain products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q4-2019-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2020 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2020-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"Barely a year following the divestiture from General Motors in 2007, we were faced with the effects of the 2008 financial crisis, while rightsizing and managing a newly independent enterprise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q1-2020-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2020 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2020-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"But again, the approach is long-term cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q1-2020-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2020 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2020-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"The decrease was principally driven by lower net sales and restructuring charges, partially offset by lower incentive compensation expense, price increases on certain products and favorable material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q2-2020-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2020 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"Unfortunately, a weaker global outlook has led to a number of restructuring initiatives, including reductions of both our hourly and salary workforce and the ongoing reassessment of the timing and cadence of various capital investment, commercial and product development initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q2-2020-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2020 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"As Dave mentioned, a weaker global outlook and current end market conditions have led us to implement a number of restructuring initiatives across our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q2-2020-ear.aspx"},{"c":"ALSN 2020 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2020-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"The decrease was principally driven by lower net sales, partially offset by price increases on certain products and lower compensation expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q3-2020-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2020 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2020-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"The decrease was principally driven by lower net sales and higher sales, general and administrative expenses due to unfavorable product warranty adjustments, partially offset by lower manufacturing expense, price increases on certain products and the intra-year timing of product initiative spending.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q3-2020-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2020 Q4","e":"alsn","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"…or a midpoint increase of 12%, compared to net sales for 2020, reflecting higher demand in Global On-Highway and Service Parts, Support Equipment & Other end markets as a result of the ongoing global recovery, continued improvement in customer demand and price increases on certain products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q4-2020-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2021 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"The decrease was principally driven by lower net sales and unfavorable material costs, partially offset by price increases on certain products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q1-2021-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2021 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"Our 2021 net sales guidance reflects higher demand in the Global On-Highway Service Parts, Support Equipment & Other and North America Off-Highway end markets as a result of the ongoing global economic recovery and price increases on certain products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q1-2021-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2021 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"The increase was principally driven by higher net sales, 2020 restructuring charges that did not recur in 2021 and price increases on certain products, partially offset by unfavorable material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q2-2021-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2021 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"Our 2021 net sales guidance continues to reflect higher demand in the Global On-Highway, Service Parts, Support Equipment & Other and North America Off-Highway end markets as a result of the ongoing global economic recovery and price increases on certain products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q2-2021-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2021 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"Selling, general and administrative expenses increased $11 million from the same period in 2020, principally driven by higher incentive compensation expense and higher commercial activity spending, partially offset by the impact of 2020 restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q2-2021-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2021 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"Engineering research and development expenses increased $3 million from the same period in 2020, principally driven by increased product initiatives spending, partially offset by the impact of 2020 restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q2-2021-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2021 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2021-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"As a result of the ongoing recovery, we are reaffirming the 2021 guidance ranges released to the market on April 28.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q2-2021-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2021 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2021-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"In addition to Allison's 2021 net sales guidance, we are reaffirming our guidance ranges for net income in the range of $395 million to $465 million, adjusted EBITDA in the range of $795 million to $885 million, net cash provided by operating activities in the range of $585 million to $655…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q2-2021-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2021 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fred Bohley","x":"The decrease was essentially driven by unfavorable material costs partially offset by higher net sales and price increases on certain products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q3-2021-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2021 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fred Bohley","x":"Our 2021 net sales guidance reflects higher demand in global On-Highway global Off-Highway and service parts support equipment in other end markets as a result of the ongoing global economic recovery and price increases on certain products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/allison-transmission-holdings-inc-alsn-q3-2021-ear/"},{"c":"ALSN 2025 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Graziosi","x":"They continue to support that very overtly, and we believe, given all the infrastructure investment that's underway with AI data centers, et cetera that that certainly bodes well for the utilization of those relevant fleets and as I said, that equipment is certainly being used right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/allison-alsn-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2025 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Graziosi","x":"External pressures related to tariffs, evolving trade policies, and upcoming emissions regulations, in addition to broader economic uncertainties have led to more cautious purchasing decisions from end users, which has impacted visibility and predictability in terms of demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/allison-alsn-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2025 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"G. Frederick Bohley","x":"Specific to tariffs, it's really important to continue to highlight that 85% of our components are purchased in The U. S., Mexico, and Canada with the majority of those being in The U. S. The bigger impact on tariffs and then Section 232 tariffs becomes, I think, vehicle pricing, total…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/allison-alsn-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2025 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Angel Castillo","x":"With the $450 million that you did this year, the long-term agreements you have in place, and the pass-through of kind of the tariffs that have already kind of rolled through, what's kind of the price increase we should expect next year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/allison-alsn-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2025 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Graziosi","x":"So just a quick reference back to our August call when we talked about I mentioned what we were starting to see in terms of revisions to build rates, getting to your question with the OEM announcements that we referenced at the time layoffs, et cetera.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/allison-alsn-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2025 Q4","e":"alsn","d":"2026-02-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"With recent events providing improved clarity on the timing and impact of tariffs and emissions regulations, we are beginning to see early signs of demand improvements within our largest end market, North America On Highway, and a rebound from the trough in the 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/23/allison-transmission-alsn-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2025 Q4","e":"alsn","d":"2026-02-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott A. Mell","x":"And then, obviously, on the tariffs, I have not been online today, so I am not sure where we are at.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/23/allison-transmission-alsn-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2025 Q4","e":"alsn","d":"2026-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"With greater purchasing scale as well as vertical integration opportunities in manufacturing in best-cost countries, Allison expects opportunities for synergy realization and cost reduction initiatives within our operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/23/allison-transmission-alsn-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2025 Q4","e":"alsn","d":"2026-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott A. Mell","x":"Our net income guidance for 2026 includes approximately $70 million of one-time pretax expenses associated with the separation, integration, and restructuring of the Allison Off Highway segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/23/allison-transmission-alsn-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2026-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"Although order trends have shown strength and imply a slight ramp throughout the year, we believe there is still uncertainty surrounding geopolitical impacts including tariffs and final rulings on emissions regulations that are hindering end users' new vehicle purchasing decisions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/allison-alsn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2026-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"To your point, I think we made this comment on the last call when we were asked about tariffs and so we just got on the call; we have not checked the news a minute or two to see what happened.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/allison-alsn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2026-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tami Zakaria","x":"And related to that, could you comment on price realization by segment—On-Highway and Off Highway, please?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/allison-alsn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2026-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott A. Mell","x":"Our net income guidance for 2026 includes more than $100 million of one-time pretax expenses associated with the separation, integration, and restructuring of the Allison Off Highway business unit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/allison-alsn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2026-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"Allison Transmission Holdings, Inc.’s reach is now greatly expanded with our global operations allowing for more localized production and opportunities for cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/allison-alsn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2026-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"David S. Graziosi","x":"It has been encouraging to see the groundwork laid prior to the transaction translate into real momentum and reaffirmed guidance in achieving our target of $120 million of annual run-rate synergies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/allison-alsn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q1","e":"alsn","d":"2026-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Analyst","x":"I understand reaffirmed guidance calls for both to grow on a year-over-year basis for 2026, but can you give us some color on the seasonality of working capital for the new business and what Allison Transmission Holdings, Inc.’s free cash flow profile looks like now through the year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/allison-alsn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2026-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Graziosi","x":"Although we continue to see end-user purchasing decisions influenced by geopolitical impacts, including tariffs and emissions regulations, we expect sequential improvement in volumes in the second half of 2026 for medium-duty and Class 8 vocational trucks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/allison-transmission-alsn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2026-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Mell","x":"I think the off-highway business, there's a lot less volatility relative to material costs, just given the nature of that business's ability to pass those on a more timely basis than what you have seen historically with the transmission business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/allison-transmission-alsn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2026-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Kyle Menges","x":"I'm just trying to understand how much of that is just pricing from pass-through mechanisms to offset quite elevated material costs versus, I guess, more real price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/allison-transmission-alsn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Mell","x":"Our net income guidance for 2026 includes approximately $140 million of onetime pretax expenses associated with the separation, integration and restructuring of the Allison Off-Highway business unit, including approximately $75 million of expenses related to the stepped-up basis in inventory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/allison-transmission-alsn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q2","e":"alsn","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jerry Revich","x":"I wanted to ask the sources of cost savings, pretty procurement heavy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/allison-transmission-alsn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALSN 2026 Q3","e":"alsn","d":"2026-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott A. Mell","x":"Our net income guidance for 2026 includes approximately $125 million of 1-time pretax expenses associated with the separation integration, and restructuring o